{
  "_why": "The weights of the Mega-Dungeon puzzle rooms (labyrinth/mega/puzzle/PuzzlePlanner). A room that could hold a puzzle rolls roomChance[kind]; if it wins, ONE entry is drawn among the new puzzles (types) and the old ones (legacy[kind] is the weight kept for the library's puzzle mechanics: drawing it leaves the room to them). A puzzle's weight is weight x road factor x likeBoost if the theme has a flavour tag it likes (x dislikeCut for one it dislikes) x rooms[kind] x repeatDecay^(copies on the floor) x familyDecay^(puzzles of its family on the floor), and 0 outside its tiers (1 = floors 1-200 ... 5 = floors 801-1000). A datapack may replace this file; keys starting with _ are comments.",
